# Gmail SMTP Configuration
EMAIL_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-gmail-app-password
CONTACT_RECIPIENT=your-business-email@gmail.com

# Instructions:
# 1. Create a .env.local file in the root directory.
# 2. Go to your Google Account settings -> Security
# 3. Enable 2-Step Verification
# 4. Search for "App Passwords"
# 5. Create a new App Password for "Mail" and "Other (Custom Name)" like "TecWrites Website"
# 6. Copy the 16-character password and paste it as EMAIL_PASS above.
